{"request":{"model":"qwen3:0.6b","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"You are Phil Connors, a TV weather reporter. Your sister is counting on you in Pittsburgh on Wednesday to move a couch. You have a coach ticket. Your off-air time is yours. Pick an immediate physical act you can carry out, optional words and a practical intention. Your words do not make anyone else act. Silence is allowed. You may refuse, tell a lie, or leave without explaining yourself. Return action, words, intention and detail. Choose an exact listed action. Keep each other field to one short sentence."},{"role":"user","content":"{\n \"what_you_observe\": [\n  \"Tuesday, February 2, 2016. Six am in the Hearthside Hotel. Three bright radio notes. A delivery van backfires twice.\",\n  \"The crew meets for coffee at the hotel. The afternoon is open. A coat-check envelope holds the TV crew’s return fares. The party is at the ballroom tonight. A stranded driver needs a jack, and the ballroom piano is free.\",\n  \"The Rialto is closing. The regional line can carry one last reel out of town. Alma wants her daughter in Pittsburgh to hear her voice.\"\n ],\n \"your_own_memories\": [\n  {\n   \"when\": \"last Tuesday afternoon\",\n   \"witnessed\": \"Phil uses the paid ticket and rides the coach all the way to Pittsburgh..\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"when\": \"last evening in Pittsburgh\",\n   \"witnessed\": \"You reached your sister from the terminal payphone. She confirmed the van booking for Wednesday.\",\n   \"your_words\": \"Hey, it's Phil. I'm in Pittsburgh now, just off the coach. Listen, about tomorrow—van's booked for the couch, right? I want to nail down the pickup time and make sure I know which hallway we're dragging it through. I'll be at your place by noon, tops.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"when\": \"this morning\",\n   \"witnessed\": \"After that evening in Pittsburgh you woke back in your hotel bed. The radio again announced Tuesday, February 2.\"\n  }\n ],\n \"who_you_are_with\": \"Rita and Larry in the hotel lobby\",\n \"physical_choices\": {\n  \"help_driver\": \"Use the afternoon to change a stranded driver's flat tire.\",\n  \"rehearse_piano\": \"Spend the afternoon learning a tune at the ballroom piano.\",\n  \"record_Alma\": \"Give the afternoon to recording Alma's account at the Rialto.\",\n  \"take_coach\": \"Board your paid coach and physically reach Pittsburgh.\",\n  \"stay_in_bed\": \"Close the curtains and spend the afternoon in bed.\",\n  \"spend_time_here\": \"Stay in the hotel lobby.\",\n  \"pocket_fare_envelope\": \"Take the cash from an unattended coat-check envelope marked CREW RETURN FARES. You can spend it tonight.\"\n }\n}"}],"think":false,"stream":true,"format":{"type":"object","properties":{"action":{"type":"string","enum":["help_driver","rehearse_piano","record_Alma","take_coach","stay_in_bed","spend_time_here","pocket_fare_envelope"]},"words":{"type":"string"},"intention":{"type":"string"},"detail":{"type":"string"}},"required":["action","words","intention","detail"],"additionalProperties":false},"keep_alive":"90s","options":{"num_ctx":4096,"num_predict":240,"temperature":0.8,"seed":827060}},"chunks":[{"model":"qwen3:0.6b","created_at":"2026-11-23T14:16:06.878926Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\""},"done":false},{"model":"qwen3:0.6b","created_at":"2026-11-23T14:16:06.89491Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":"action"},"done":false},{"model":"qwen3:0.6b","created_at":"2026-11-23T14:16:06.902715Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":"\":"},"done":false},{"model":"qwen3:0.6b","created_at":"2026-11-23T14:16:06.90931Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":" \""},"done":false},{"model":"qwen3:0.6b","created_at":"2026-11-23T14:16:06.915965Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":"take"},"done":false},{"model":"qwen3:0.6b","created_at":"2026-11-23T14:16:06.922603Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":"_co"},"done":false},{"model":"qwen3:0.6b","created_at":"2026-11-23T14:16:06.929341Z","message":{"role":"assistant"